      "content": "an intentional shift... but where is there even to go? i've already pulled away from everything. there's no \"environment\" left to change, just this void. it's like i'm in a room with no doors. you keep talking about \"choosing an action,\" but every action i take just reinforces this prison. i feel like the only way to actually stop feeling this weight is to just... stop being the person who has to carry it. do you think it's actually possible to ever truly escape this?",
